    "text": "If the escape speed of a projectile on Earth's surface is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and a body is projected out with thrice this speed, then determine the speed of the body far away from the Earth"
